From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] The field not paused while the options' page is up
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The start menu pauses everyone's movement while it's open; the options'
page in the lower menu's panel (patch 0040: OPTIONS tapped, or chosen
from the X menu) lets them go while it's up, so people walk about and
changes are seen as they're made (the follower Pokémon coming out or
going in, patch 0056). The player stays still (the start menu's task
runs, the field's input waits), every button the page's. Paused again as
the page closes, as the start menu keeps it.
---
 src/start_menu.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/start_menu.c b/src/start_menu.c
index 766910c7..6cd6f541 100644
--- a/src/start_menu.c
+++ b/src/start_menu.c
@@ -1807,6 +1807,8 @@ static BOOL StartMenu_PortSaveClosing(FieldSystem *fieldSystem)
 // By another of the menu's buttons: that one acted on, as if pressed then
 // (the bag, the party, the trainer case and the save straight on from the
 // black panel; the others once it's faded in).
+// The field isn't paused while the page is up (people walk about, changes
+// seen as they're made); the player stays still, every button the page's.
 static int sPortOptionsPhase;
 static int sPortOptionsFrames;
 static int sPortOptionsAfter;
@@ -1827,6 +1829,7 @@ static void StartMenu_PortOptions(FieldTask *fieldTask)
     switch (sPortOptionsPhase) {
     case 0:
         // (already black, OPTIONS tapped in an app of the panel's: at once)
+        MapObjectMan_UnpauseAllMovement(fieldSystem->mapObjMan); // (paused again as it closes)
         NitroPort_LowerMenuKeepShown(TRUE);
         NitroPort_LowerMenuFadePanel(TRUE);
         NitroPort_LowerMenuSelect(PORT_BUTTON_OPTIONS);
@@ -1888,6 +1891,7 @@ static void StartMenu_PortOptions(FieldTask *fieldTask)
             break;
         }
 
+        MapObjectMan_PauseAllMovement(fieldSystem->mapObjMan); // (as the start menu keeps it: unpaused as it ends)
         after = sPortOptionsAfter;
         sPortOptionsPhase = 0;
         NitroPort_LowerMenuTakePress();
-- 
